      <data key="d1">- API Gateway (Nginx/Envoy/Kong) for routing, rate-limiting, auth at edge.
Databases &amp; Storage:
- PostgreSQL for relational data (users, playlists, subscriptions, etc.).
- Redis for caching and sessions.
- Elasticsearch/OpenSearch for full-text search &amp; autocomplete.
- ClickHouse or similar data warehouse for analytics events.
- S3-compatible object storage for audio and images.
- CDN (CloudFront/Fastly/Cloudflare) for asset and audio delivery.
Infrastructure &amp; DevOps:
- Docker for containerization.
- Kubernetes (GKE/EKS/AKS) for orchestration.
- Vault / Secrets Manager for secrets.
- CI/CD via GitHub Actions / GitLab CI.
- Observability via Prometheus + Grafana, central logging, and tracing with OpenTelemetry.
2. Microservices (High-Level)
-----------------------------
1) API Gateway / Backend for Frontend (BFF)
- Single HTTP entrypoint for clients.</data>
