    <node id="chunk_9">
      <data key="d0">chunk</data>
      <data key="d1">-------------------------------
Key pages/routes:
- Public:
  - /           → Landing/marketing page.
  - /login      → Auth.
  - /signup     → Auth.
  - /artist/:id → Public artist view.
  - /album/:id  → Public album view or preview.
- Authenticated app:
  - /home                       → Personalized home feed.
  - /search                     → Full search UI.
  - /collection/tracks          → Liked songs.
  - /collection/playlists       → User playlists.
  - /collection/albums          → Saved albums.
  - /collection/artists         → Followed artists.</data>
