    <node id="chunk_10">
      <data key="d0">chunk</data>
      <data key="d1">- /playlist/:id               → Playlist details &amp; play.
  - /queue                      → Queue detail (could also be a modal).
  - /settings/account           → Account info.
  - /settings/subscription      → Plan &amp; billing.
  - /settings/privacy           → Content &amp; privacy preferences.
- Creator portal:
  - /creator/dashboard
  - /creator/uploads
  - /creator/analytics
- Admin:
  - /admin                      → Admin dashboard.
  - /admin/users
  - /admin/content
  - /admin/flags
Global UI components:
- Persistent bottom player bar.
- Left navigation (Home, Search, Your Library).
- Top bar with search, profile dropdown.
- Queue / Now Playing side panel.
5. Feature Checklist (Spotify-like)
-----------------------------------
A. User &amp; Auth
- Email/password auth &amp; social login.
- Email verification &amp; password reset.
- Profile editing (name, avatar).</data>
