      <data key="d0">entity</data>
    </node>
    <node id="E. Search">
      <data key="d0">entity</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Unified">
      <data key="d0">entity</data>
    </node>
    <node id="chunk_13">
      <data key="d0">chunk</data>
      <data key="d1">- Autocomplete suggestions.
- Search history and clear history.
- Filter by content type.
F. Recommendations &amp; Discovery
- Personalized home feed.
- “Because you listened to X” rows.
- Song Radio and Artist Radio.
- Auto-generated Daily Mix-style playlists.
- Weekly discovery playlist (like Discover Weekly).
G. Social
- Follow users (friends).
- Friend activity feed.
- Collaborative playlists with multiple editors.
- Share links for tracks, albums, artists, and playlists.
- Optional embeddable mini-player for shared content.
H. Subscription / Monetization
- Free tier (ad-supported with lower bitrate).
- Premium tier (ad-free, high bitrate, offline for native apps).
- Payment integration (Stripe/Razorpay/etc.).
- Plan change flows, cancellations, proration behavior.
- Billing history and invoices.
I. Ads (Free Tier)
- Audio ad slots between tracks.</data>
      <data key="d2">5</data>
    </node>
